    {
      "text": "And here's the twist. Both men had one Champions League night that decided everything.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "THE TWIST",
        "body": "Ronaldo scored in Moscow, then missed in the shootout. Kane scored in stoppage time in Munich. Only one of them went home with the trophy."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ronaldo's penalty was saved in Moscow. United still won the shootout six-five.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "manutd",
        "away": "chelsea",
        "hs": 1,
        "as": 1,
        "date": "21 May 2008",
        "comp": "Champions League final",
        "note": "United win 6-5 on penalties"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kane scored deep in stoppage time against PSG. Bayern still went out, six-five on aggregate.",
